  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><img src=\"https://v.blakesmods.com/banners/mysticalagradditions?source=modrinth\"></span></p>\n<p><a title=\"Mystical Agriculture\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/mystical-agriculture\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://blakesmods.com/img/banner/mysticalagriculture_required.png\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"display: flex;\" align=\"left\"><a style=\"margin-right: 8px;\" href=\"https://blakesmods.com/mystical-agradditions\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint?url=https://api.blakesmods.com/v2/badges/mysticalagradditions/downloads&amp;style=for-the-badge\"> </a> <a style=\"margin-right: 8px;\" href=\"https://blakesmods.com/mystical-agradditions\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint?url=https://api.blakesmods.com/v2/badges/mysticalagradditions/version&amp;style=for-the-badge\"> </a> <a style=\"margin-right: 8px;\" href=\"https://blakesmods.com/mystical-agradditions\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint?url=https://api.blakesmods.com/v2/badges/mysticalagradditions/mc_version&amp;style=for-the-badge\"> </a> <a href=\"https://blakesmods.com/wiki/mysticalagradditions\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=維基&amp;message=查看&amp;color=brightgreen&amp;style=for-the-badge\"> </a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">本模組為&nbsp;<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/mystical-agriculture\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">神秘農業（Mystical Agriculture）</a>&nbsp;添加了更多內容。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><strong>功能特色</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">第 6 階精華：無盡金！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">第 6 階作物，提供高等級素材，包含下界之星、覺醒龍銅、中子素等更多資源！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">三用鎬：將鎬、斧與鏟的功能結合於單一工具中。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">匠魂（Tinkers' Construct）整合支援！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">精華煤炭：燒煉效率優於普通煤炭，可處理更多物品。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><strong>資源作物</strong></span></p>\n<p><strong><em>最後更新版本：7.0.2</em></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><em><strong>原版資源：</strong>下界之星、龍蛋</em></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><em><strong>Botania：</strong>蓋亞之魂</em></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><em><strong>Draconic Evolution：</strong>覺醒龍銅</em></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><em>Avaritia：</em></strong><em>中子素</em></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><em>Powah：</em></strong><em>硝晶</em></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"https://bisecthosting.com/blakesmods\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/fdf1b29a-987b-450e-b6d4-a16c2da8aadf.png\" width=\"1086\" height=\"170\"></strong></a></span></p>",
